Package: ecsurf
Title: Connectance-Indexed Euler Characteristic Surfaces Along Environmental Gradients
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sushovan", "Majhi", email = "s.majhi@email.gwu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Locates where community co-occurrence structure reorganizes along
    an environmental gradient, using the pre-registered estimator of Majhi et
    al.: Euler characteristic curves of flag complexes indexed by edge count
    (connectance fixed by construction), a pooled two-sample split statistic,
    a plot-position permutation test, and a within-window bootstrap interval.
    Thin wrapper over the reference Python implementation via reticulate;
    requires Python with numpy, scipy, and gudhi.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports: reticulate
Encoding: UTF-8
